config_database.json is RPCS3's per-game configuration database as its Qt
application downloads it (rpcs3qt/config_database.cpp): the response of
https://api.rpcs3.net/config/?api=v1, taken 2026-09-29 (its timestamp field:
1790656172), sha256
f7f8965ee1c1d61a48042485862558e107456c16346b4aceab7a4854e2cff9b6;
2203 games, each with the settings RPCS3 recommends for it.

The libretro core stages it as its config folder's config_database.json and
answers RPCS3's get_database_config with a game's entry (rpcs3/libretro/
libretro_game_configs.h). To refresh it, take the same response again and
record its date, timestamp and hash here.
